{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13112520","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13112520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1311252001:0":{"text":"...저 좀 도와주십시오. 알레나에게는 바레샤 가문의 피가 흐르고 있지 않습니까!","source_cn":"……求你帮帮我，她和你一样，都流淌着瓦勒沙家的血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x874096B22EF21B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311252002:0":{"text":"아직 너무 어리고, 활발하고, 사랑스러운 아이입니다... 알레나에게도 아름다운 미래가 있어야 하지 않겠습니까...!","source_cn":"她还那么年轻，那么活泼可爱，她本可以拥有一个美好的未来……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2DE7CDA22078E94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311252003:0":{"text":"...나 또한 같은 병으로 세상을 떠났다는 걸 잘 알 텐데. 이런 병은 치료 방법이 없어.","source_cn":"……你该清楚，我也是因为同样的病症而死去的。这种病无人可医。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC29213DC4A7A30D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311252004:0":{"text":"압니다... 그래서 이렇게 간청을 드리는 것 아닙니까... 지금 제 앞에 서 계신 걸 보니, 당신이... 당신이 알레나를 되살아나게 할 수 있으시겠죠?","source_cn":"是的……所以我才恳求你……你现在就站在我面前，所以你也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994692974279B6FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311252005:0":{"text":"목소리가 익숙한데... 루보미르? 설마 이게 루보미르가 전에 말했던 대공과의 만남인 건가?","source_cn":"这声音好熟悉……是柳博米尔？这难道就是柳博米尔之前说的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5740442E676CF1C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1311252005":{"text":"목소리가 익숙한데... 루보미르? 설마 이게 루보미르가 전에 말했던 대공과의 만남인 건가?","source_cn":"这声音好熟悉……是柳博米尔？这难道就是柳博米尔之前说的，他和大公的那次会谈？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5740442E676CF1C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1311252007:0":{"text":"...그레이브본이 된다는 게 어떤 의미인 줄 알아? 사람들에게 미움받고 경멸을 받으면서 영원의 고독 속에서 서서히 썩어가게 되지. 감정을 잃고, 이성도 잃고, 멍한 상태가 돼.","source_cn":"……你知道成为亡灵意为着什么吗？被人厌恶和唾弃，在永恒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75FAEAAE5A7F03A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1311252008:0":{"text":"아니, 그레이브본이 된 그 순간부터, 즐거움, 생기, 아름다움... 그런 형용사는 알레나와는 상관없는 것이 되겠지!","source_cn":"不，从成为亡灵的那一刻起，快乐、活泼、美好……所有这些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC39468A809CB7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1311252009:0":{"text":"이게 바로 그녀가 원하는 거야? 아니면 네가 원하는 건가?","source_cn":"这是她想要的吗？还是说，这是你想要的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8FAB4336BD33851","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1311252010:0":{"text":"그레이브본... 저는 두렵지도 않고, 그런 것 따위는 상관없습니다... 알레나가 살아나기만 한다면... 제발 부탁드립니다, 루보미르 님...","source_cn":"亡灵……我不害怕，我不在乎……我只要亚莲娜活过来……求...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450EBC4477DBAF44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1311252011:0":{"text":"...아니, 거절하지.","source_cn":"……不，我拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0E1837E4898F077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1311252012:0":{"text":"루보미르 님!","source_cn":"柳博米尔大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47375F9098D1A5B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1311252013:0":{"text":"거절한다.","source_cn":"我拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C66296031981561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1311252014:0":{"text":"지금 네가 해야 할 건 신께 기도하는 것뿐이야... 기도하면 신께서 불쌍히 여기실지도 모르지.","source_cn":"你现在唯一该做的是向神祈祷……祈祷吧，或许神明会降下怜悯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED3F9AFB89ED2505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1311252015:0":{"text":"지그문트, 이게 바로 내 마지막 답이야. 난 이만 가볼 테니 배웅할 것 없어. 다시는 날 찾아오지도 말고.","source_cn":"齐格蒙德，这就是我最后的答复。我该走了，不必送我，也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE4974DB9AFA3E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1311252016:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1311252017:0":{"text":"...그렇다면, 신께 기도하겠습니다.","source_cn":"……那么，我会向神明祈祷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AD5C91B091DFBE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1311252018:0":{"text":"제게 응답해 주신 신께 기도하도록 하지요...","source_cn":"向愿意回应我的神祈祷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A46C29917AE0055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1311252019:0":{"text":"이제 어떡하죠? 대공에게 가볼까요?","source_cn":"现在怎么办？要不要去找大公？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6019996D4CE3E5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1311252020:0":{"text":"잠깐, 빨리 숨어. 누가 오는 것 같아!","source_cn":"等等，快躲好，又有人过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96E0BDD1427B5E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1311252021:0":{"text":"어라, 딜그레이에요. 그 궁정의 마법사 말이에요!","source_cn":"咦，是迪尔格雷，那个宫廷魔法师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02790915E01981A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1311252022:0":{"text":"루보미르 님과의 대화가 잘 풀리지 않은 것 같군요. 제가 추측했던 것처럼 그는 거절했겠지요, 그렇지 않습니까?","source_cn":"您与柳博米尔先生的谈话看起来并不顺利。正如我所猜测的那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CFB47B18767C30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1311252023:0":{"text":"그러네...","source_cn":"是的……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x687B30B422B411AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1311252024:0":{"text":"그럼, 다른 방법이 없겠군요.","source_cn":"那么，您没有别的办法了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB59CC2C8885641C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1311252025:0":{"text":"전...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF86786B0375A8C9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1311252026:0":{"text":"하지만 알레나 공주님을 세상으로 되돌릴 방법은 아직 남아있습니다. 그저 듀라에 대한 연민이 현실과 맞지 않는 환상을 품고 있어 받아들이기 어려우신 것뿐이지요.","source_cn":"但您知道，让亚莲娜殿下重返世间的选项仍然存在。只是您还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D9F5F0A2E0FB9B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1311252027:0":{"text":"...그 ...말이 맞구나.","source_cn":"……你……说得对。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72FA90D76D58ECF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1311252028:0":{"text":"네 방법을 내게 알려주거라.","source_cn":"告诉我吧，你的办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25D0123759BC5E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1311252029:0":{"text":"결심을 하신 건가요? “후회”라는 건 선택지에 없습니다.","source_cn":"您下定决心了吗？要知道，“后悔”并不在可选项之中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944445AC6D32913B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1311252030:0":{"text":"결심했네.","source_cn":"是的，我决定了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8C15375A1EE5C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1311252031:0":{"text":"아, 좋습니다. 세상에 유일하고 진정한 신 “위대한 의지”는 대공과 같은 신도를 좋아하실 겁니다.","source_cn":"啊，真好。世间唯一的真神，“伟大意志”会喜爱您这样的信徒的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EFB930A4E888A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1311252032:0":{"text":"위대한 의지...? 유일하고 진정한 신?","source_cn":"伟大意志……？唯一的真神？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35672289742171A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1311252033:0":{"text":"그렇습니다. 거짓된 신은 평범한 사람의 기도에 응답하지 않고, 못 들은 체하며 고통과 재난이 횡행하도록 두지요.","source_cn":"正是。虚假的神明在凡人祈求时默然不应，充耳不闻，任由痛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F047C281BBB414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1311252034:0":{"text":"하지만 “위대한 의지”는 다릅니다. 도움을 청하면 반드시 응답하십니다.","source_cn":"但“伟大意志”不同，只要祈求帮助，祂一定会回应。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBACB817B05502F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1311252035:0":{"text":"대공의 신실함을 보여주십시오. 위대한 의지께서는 진정한 신도의 기도에 응답하실 겁니다!","source_cn":"展现你的虔诚吧，伟大意志会回应真正信徒的祈求！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE081A211D8CCF534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1311252036:0":{"text":"내... 내가 어떻게 해야 하는가? 알레나의 부활과 내 모든 걸 바꿀 수 있네. 내가 가진 것이라면... 모두 바칠 수 있어!","source_cn":"我……我该怎么做？我愿用一切换取亚莲娜复活，只要我有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17D12B8A918E31F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1311252037:0":{"text":"그렇다면, 저를 따라오십시오.","source_cn":"那么，请您随我来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB79B134396C47D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1311252038:0":{"text":"이제 그 거짓된 예배당에서 진정한 신을 섬길 때가 되었습니다.","source_cn":"那座虚伪的小礼拜堂里应该敬奉真正的神祇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x084DE092BA16474F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:62:13011249:0":{"text":"접견실 창문 아래에 숨어 바레샤 대공과 루보미르의 대화를 몰래 엿들었다.","source_cn":"你们躲在会客室的窗户下，悄悄听着瓦勒沙大公和柳博米尔的对话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB68B3B7174830B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:63:13011249:0":{"text":"접견실 창문 아래에 숨어 바레샤 대공과 루보미르의 대화를 몰래 엿들었다.","source_cn":"你们躲在会客室的窗户下，悄悄听着瓦勒沙大公和柳博米尔的对话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB68B3B7174830B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"뭐라고 하는지 들어보자","source_cn":"听听他们在说什么","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x186AB1CE9AEB71F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뭐라고 하는지 들어보자","female":"뭐라고 하는지 들어보자","variant_male_record_index":"68034","